{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Judges and officers.</b> Judges to render judgment; officers to compel the litigants to fulfill the ruling against them. And thus it says: ״ויהי דוד עושה משפט וצדקה לכל עמו״, ״ויואב בן צרויה על הצבא״ — what does this have to do with that? But David would render judgment and Joab would compel [them] to fulfill the judgment's decree."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:01:00.857004135Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}